  "sections": [
    {
      "selector": "section",
      "type": "hero",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 116,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 664,
      "heading": "Master your speaking skills.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FBFDFA",
      "callsToAction": [
        "START 14 DAYS FREE TRIAL",
        "SEE HOW IT WORKS",
        "New topic",
        "RECORD 30 SECONDS"
      ],
      "text": "Your personal AI speaking coach Master your speaking skills. Locuta helps you master communication through personalized, real-time AI coaching. Practice real scenarios, get instant feedback, and build the confidence to be heard, 60 seconds at a time. START 14 DAYS FREE TRIAL SEE HOW IT WORKS 14 days free · no card required · start with one 60-second rep Real-time AI feedback 6 Coaching styles Private Judgment-free space Ready for today's rep? Let's go! READY FREE · 30s How do you actually sound? Record 30 seconds. Get scored. YOUR PROMPT “Share one small thing that went well for you this week.",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "section",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 832,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 535,
      "heading": "Communication is the skill that moves careers.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FBFDFA",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "WHY IT MATTERS Communication is the skill that moves careers. The good news: unlike talent, it's trainable. Here's what the research says. 85% of career success comes down to communication skills, not technical ability. Carnegie Foundation & Stanford Research 75% of people feel anxious speaking in front of others. You are far from alone. National Institute of Mental Health #1 Communication ranks as the most in-demand skill employers look for today. LinkedIn Global Talent Trends",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "section",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 1367,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 642,
      "heading": "Built to make you a confident communicator.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FBFDFA",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "WHY LOCUTA Built to make you a confident communicator. Three things that turn nervous speakers into people others lean in to hear. AI that learns your voice Get specific feedback on your pace, clarity, filler words and delivery. Your coach adapts to how you actually speak and tailors every session. Personalized coaching that adapts to you Six coaching styles From supportive to bossy, choose the energy that brings out your best, and switch whenever your goal or mood changes. A coaching personality for every moment Every real scenario Rehearse the moments that count: interviews, pitches, tough t",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "section",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 410,
      "y": 2010,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 219,
      "heading": "Collect a sticker every day you show up.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FBFDFA",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "Collect a sticker every day you show up. Finish your daily rep, peel the sticker, keep the flame alive. Fill the week to unlock a rare one. MON TUE WED THU FRI SAT SUN",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#loop",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 370,
      "y": 2229,
      "width": 1180,
      "height": 481,
      "heading": "Four taps. Sixty seconds.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FBFDFA",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "THE DAILY LOOP Four taps. Sixty seconds. 1 Pick a path Public speaking, storytelling, pitching. Choose what matters to you today. 2 Pick a coach Supportive, funny, bossy. Set the exact energy you want in your ear. 3 Speak out loud Answer a real scenario. Sixty seconds, spoken, not typed or overthought. 4 Collect your sticker Instant scores on delivery, clarity and confidence, then keep your streak alive.",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#categories",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 370,
      "y": 2710,
      "width": 1180,
      "height": 713,
      "heading": "Pick a path. Level it up.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FBFDFA",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "SKILL PATHS Pick a path. Level it up. Six skill paths built with speaking experts, covering the situations that matter most. Public Speaking From a five-minute update to a full keynote, without the nerves. Storytelling Craft narratives people actually remember and repeat. Creator Speaking Sound natural and hold attention on video, podcasts and recordings. Casual Conversation Build easy confidence for small talk and quick conversations. Workplace Communication Own meetings, reviews and the tough conversations that count. Pitch Anything Win over investors, customers and your team with clarity.",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#tones",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3423,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 589,
      "heading": "Six voices. Your kind of energy.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "PICK YOUR COACH Six voices. Your kind of energy. Same lesson, six coaches in your ear. Pick the energy you want, then switch anytime, even mid-streak. Normal EVERYDAY Clear, simple, everyday conversational style. Supportive GENTLE Soft, kind and reassuring, like a supportive friend. Inspiring HIGH ENERGY Energizing and passionate, like a motivational coach. Funny PLAYFUL Entertaining, playful and casual with light humor. Diplomatic BALANCED Calm, professional and trustworthy. A balanced approach. Bossy NO-NONSENSE Commanding, no-nonsense, authoritative leadership.",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#pricing",
      "type": "content",
