      "callsToAction": [
        "START FREE",
        "GET STARTED"
      ],
      "text": "JOIN THE CLUB Start free. Keep improving. Free Trial $0 14 days, then pick a plan START FREE ✓ Up to 10 sessions a day ✓ Communication analysis ✓ AI feedback summary ✓ Daily streak & stickers BEST VALUE · 40% OFF Annual $11.99 /mo $19.99 Early-member price — 40% off. Billed annually ($143.88/yr). GET STARTED ✓ Unlimited sessions ✓ Full analytics dashboard ✓ Personalized AI coaching ✓ All 6 paths & coaches ✓ Priority support ✓ Early access to new modules Monthly $16.99 /mo $21.99 Early-member price — save 23%. Billed monthly. Cancel anytime. GET STARTED ✓ Unlimited sessions ✓ Full analytics das",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "section",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 370,
      "y": 4745,
      "width": 1180,
      "height": 698,
      "heading": "Frequently asked questions.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FBFDFA",
      "callsToAction": [
        "How does the AI coaching work?–",
