      "text": "GOOD QUESTIONS Frequently asked questions. How does the AI coaching work? – Locuta analyzes your voice across pace, clarity, confidence, filler words and delivery, then gives feedback that gets more tailored the more you practice. Do I need special equipment? + How fast will I improve? + Can I cancel anytime? + Is my voice data private? +",
